B.WT=new A.w(B.a_p,["The piezoelectric effect! When voltage is applied, the crystal bends. By rapidly toggling voltage ON and OFF hundreds of times a second, it vibrates the air into sound waves.","An active buzzer has a built-in oscillator: apply 5V and it beeps at a fixed pitch. A passive buzzer needs an external PWM tone signal, letting you play different musical notes!","It outputs an 880 Hz square wave on the pin, toggling 880 times per second to create the musical note A5 (a high warning chime).","Yes! By stringing together different frequencies (like C, D, E, G notes) with delays in code, passive buzzers can play the Star Wars or Mario themes."],t.w)
B.Wa=new A.w(B.a9,["Buzzer (Piezo Sounder & Audible Alerts)","How does a piezo buzzer vibrate to produce sound and audible warnings?","A buzzer converts electrical oscillations into sound waves. Inside, a piezoelectric ceramic crystal flexes rapidly back and forth when pulsed with an alternating signal (PWM tone). Changing frequency changes the musical pitch (e.g. 440 Hz = low tone, 880 Hz = high alert).","Real-Life Memory Analogy: Like a guard dog alert bell or a chirping cricket! When excited by electricity, the piezo crystal flaps hundreds of times per second to broadcast an alert across the room.","Cause & Effect: Why use a buzzer instead of a light? Sound travels through walls and obstacles, instantly grabbing human attention from 360\xb0 even when the user is looking away from the robot!","Real-World Everyday Places: Microwave cook timers, car reverse parking sensors, smoke detectors, digital alarm clocks, game shows, and metal detectors.","When to Use It: Whenever your robot needs an audible alarm \u2014 collision warning (ultrasonic distance < 10 cm), timer completion, or keypad button clicks.",B.SH,B.SL,B.WT],t.R)
B.Y5=new A.w(B.n,[B.bV,"\u092a\u0940\u091c\u093c\u094b \u0921\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0915","\u0915\u0902\u092a\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u092a\u0930\u094d\u0926\u093e","\u0935\u094b\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0947\u091c \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u092e\u0941\u0921\u093c\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0939\u0935\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0927\u094d\u0935\u0928\u093f \u0924\u0930\u0902\u0917\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"],t.M)
